{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/03/5066216/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紫のシャツ！故に乃木カラー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨風が、やばいですね...。\n電車が、止まったり...。\n傘が、ぐしゃぐしゃに潰れたり...。\n人が、飛ばされたり...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"故にこないだお休みやったとき握手会の服を買いにいきました故に！いいのがあった～(ｏ'∀'ｏ)ふっふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪では服をチェンジして2パターン披露になるかもえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"故に\nみなさまのコメントが「故に」だらけでめっちゃ嬉しかった故に。ありがとうございます\n是非、ハマってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"故に\n風邪ひいたらあかんで～(ﾉ)･ω･(ヾ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/03/5066216/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}